@startuml
title Governed legal workflow + source genealogy + semantic non-promotion TOE handoff

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "SensibLaw / legal workflow\ncanonical owners" as Legal
component "PNF source genealogy\ncanonical owner" as Source
component "PNF distilled non-promotion\ncompatibility/process facade" as Distilled
component "GovernedLegalWorkflow\nSourceGenealogyTOEExact" as LegalSource
component "GovernedLegalWorkflow\nSourceSemanticTOEExact" as Join
component "EverythingTOE\nSymmetryResolved369" as Root
component "DASHI.Unifier" as Unifier
component "DASHI.Unified.Everything" as Unified

Legal --> LegalSource : exact inherited proofs
Source --> LegalSource : provenance firewalls
Source --> Distilled : canonical receipt
Distilled --> Join : false-by-construction process flags
LegalSource --> Join : same-object legal/source handoff

Join --> Root
Join --> Unifier
Join --> Unified

note right of Join
Preconditions:
- normalized owners already exist
- no Actionstep ontology
- original attribution retained

Invariants:
- workflow != truth
- review != applicability
- source count != truth
- shared lexeme != semantic identity
- diagnostic check != theorem promotion
- identifier != proof authority
- ESD mutation forbidden

Postcondition:
all three TOE facades consume
one canonical handoff
end note

@enduml
